silm:instances_papers_09_minimal_category_theory_chapters_06_cheese_trap_immunity_sections_02_face_taxon_as_identity_concrete_anchor_2_VetRecord77#vetrecord77 silm:hasLongDescription "The VetRecord77 is the veterinary record information node about Mittens, dated 2026-05-18, signed by Dr. Osei at Tartu Animal Clinic. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'VetRecord77', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
